  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a thriving and diverse civil society sector in the UK.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Share the learning materials on locally led development such as the maturity matrix for organisations. Run a tailored session on locally led development for the FCDO on making the transition to a locally led approach. Develop an engagement plan and proposed approach and principles for working with civil society for the FCDO. - Run an information session for the FCDO on the role of civil society and how best to engage. Share all materials and run ad hoc sessions on the outputs our strands of work. Invite FCDO staff to participate in all relevant workshops, UK Alliance sessions.  Involve FCDO in major events such as the Locally Led Symposium (name tbc).</narrative>
  </description>
